Rule 2 (inplace parameter must be boolean)
{v_1 : bool} |= v_1 = true ∨ v_1 = false
>>
Rule 3 (input tensor must have at least 3 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor must have 5 dimensions for batched input)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 5 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 4) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (input tensor must have valid shape dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 5 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 6 (input tensor must have 4 dimensions for non-batched input)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0
>>
Rule 7 (input tensor must have valid shape dimensions for non-batched input)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (input tensor must be consistent with output shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∧ shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1)
